{"title":"2012.09092 Sample-Efficient Reinforcement Learning via Counterfactual-Based Data Augmentation","markdown":{"headingText":"2012.09092 Sample-Efficient Reinforcement Learning via Counterfactual-Based Data Augmentation","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Chaochao Lu, Biwei Huang, Ke Wang, José Miguel Hernández-Lobato, Kun Zhang, Bernhard Schölkopf / 2020-12-16（NeurIPS 2020 Offline RL Workshop）/ arXiv:2012.09092\n- **一句话定位**：用结构因果模型（SCM）学习状态转移动态并对「若当初采用另一动作会发生什么」做个体层面反事实推理，以反事实数据增强解决批式 RL 中的机制异质性与数据稀缺问题（CTRLg 群体策略、CTRLp 个体化策略）。\n- **研究问题**：医疗等场景中每个患者记录极少且不可再探索，患者对同一治疗反应各异；标准基于模型的 RL 缺少噪声项 U 而无法做个体级反事实，蒙特卡洛模拟只能产生群体级随机样本，元 RL 又需大量任务数据。如何在学习转移模型的同时恢复每个时间点的噪声值，从而生成确定性的反事实样本？\n- **模型与方法**：群体版 CTRLg 假设 St+1=f(St,At,U_{t+1})，U_{t+1}⊥(St,At)，对 f 与噪声分布不加硬约束（不同于加性噪声 ANM 或后非线性等限定）；用双向条件 GAN（BiCoGAN）联合学习生成器（解码器）(St,At,U_{t+1})→S_{t+1} 与推断机（编码器）S_{t+1}→(St,At,U_{t+1})，对抗训练加上防止编码误差过拟合的正则项 λR，从而同时估计机制 f̂ 与噪声值 û_{t+1}。反事实生成：对观测三元组 ⟨st,a,st+1⟩，将 (st, a', û_{t+1}) 输入生成器得 s'_{t+1}（Pearl 三步：abduction–action–prediction 的确定性版本），替代动作 a' 从动作支撑 [b−,b+] 均匀采样，构成增广集 D̃。个体版 CTRLp 在 SCM 中显式引入随个体变化的隐因素 θC：St+1=f(St,At,θC,U_{t+1})，用 LSTM 从长度 τ 的滑动窗口序列 {S_{t−τ+1:t}, A_{t−τ+1:t}} 估计 θ̂C，再对 θ̂C 做 k-means 聚类自动分组、组内反事实增强，最后在增广数据上用 D3QN（Dueling Double DQN）学 Q 函数。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 1（可识别性）：设 St+1=f(St,At,U_{t+1})，f 光滑且对固定 (St,At) 关于 U_{t+1} 严格单调，则反事实结果 St+1,At=a'|St=st,At=a,St+1=st+1 可识别——单调性是对噪声 U 而非动作（Pearl 以前仅证二元/分类情形），且不要求 f 本身可识别，f 与 P(U) 的选择不影响反事实输出。Theorem 2（收敛性）：状态动作空间有限、学习率满足 Σα_t=∞、Σα_t²<∞ 时，增广数据上的 Q-learning 以概率 1 收敛到最优 Q*；对比 CF-PE 的概率反事实虽无模型失配时无偏但不保证收敛到最优值函数。实验：(i) 改造的 CartPole（11 个离散动作、5% 高斯噪声），SD 固定重力 50–250 条轨迹与 HD 五种重力（0.62–24.79）设定下，CTRLg 在所有样本量尤其小样本时累积奖励超过 Base-D/Base-S/Base-M、D3QN、STEVE、BCQ、PETS；CTRLp 在五种重力环境中均超过所有学群体策略的 SOTA。(ii) MIMIC-III 脓毒症（Sepsis-3）15,656 名患者、46 维状态，CTRLg/CTRLp 训练集分别 120K/80K：学到的最优策略的估计 Q 值高于医生策略，CTRLp 的个体化策略又高于 CTRLg，且动作分布更多样（倾向更多血管活性药物）。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：示范了 SCM 的第三层（反事实）推断如何直接服务于决策优化——反事实推理需要显式噪声项，这正是因果模型区别于普通动力学模型的关键；将跨个体「机制异质性与共性」显式参数化为 θC，也呼应了独立机制与模块化因果建模的思想，是离线 RL 与因果推断结合的代表性工作。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2012.09092.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","sec